{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTraces","lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceSecondOrder"],"declarations":125,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjn_borromeanVB_connected","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjn_borromeanVB_connected","kind":"theorem","line":854,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L854-L862","doc":"On a single switched-photon fourth term `V_n = B₁ B₂⁻¹`, the connected neutron adjacent-charge\ntrace has the exact opposite sign `O(h²)`:\n`tr((Q₁₂^{(n)} + Q₂₃^{(n)}) V_n) + (2/9) tr(V_n) = +2(q - 1)²(q + 1)² / (9 q²)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjp_borromeanVA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjp_borromeanVA","kind":"theorem","line":845,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L845-L852","doc":"On a single switched-photon fourth term `V_p = A₁ A₂⁻¹`, the proton adjacent-charge trace\nis strictly `O(h²)`: `tr((Q₁₂^{(p)} + Q₂₃^{(p)}) V_p) = -2(q - 1)²(q + 1)² / (9 q²)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3B_eq_one_add_h_sq_V_sub_V_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3B_eq_one_add_h_sq_V_sub_V_sq","kind":"theorem","line":834,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L834-L843","doc":"Expanded cubic identity `V_n³ = I₃ + h² V_n - h² V_n²` (`h = q - q⁻¹`) on `(1,2)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3A_eq_one_add_h_sq_V_sub_V_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3A_eq_one_add_h_sq_V_sub_V_sq","kind":"theorem","line":823,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L823-L832","doc":"Expanded cubic identity `V_p³ = I₃ + h² V_p - h² V_p²` (`h = q - q⁻¹`) on `(2,1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3B_eq_switched_photon_product","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3B_eq_switched_photon_product","kind":"theorem","line":812,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L812-L821","doc":"Exact two-photon factorisation of the Borromean neutron braid `V_n³ = (B₁ B₂⁻¹)³` into two\npure fourth-term switched photons (`φ₀ = φ₁ = 0`) with weights `+q(q - q⁻¹)` and `-q⁻¹(q - q⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3A_eq_switched_photon_product","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3A_eq_switched_photon_product","kind":"theorem","line":801,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L801-L810","doc":"Exact two-photon factorisation of the Borromean proton braid `V_p³ = (A₁ A₂⁻¹)³` into two\npure fourth-term switched photons (`φ₀ = φ₁ = 0`) with weights `+q(q - q⁻¹)` and `-q⁻¹(q - q⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.switchedPhotonB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.switchedPhotonB","kind":"def","line":796,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L796-L799","doc":"Switched four-term photon `γ'(φ₀, φ₁, φ₀₁) = 1 + φ₀ σ₀ + φ₁ σ₁ + φ₀₁ (σ₀ σ₁⁻¹)` on the\nneutron `(1,2)` weight space (`V_n = B₁ B₂⁻¹`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.switchedPhotonA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.switchedPhotonA","kind":"def","line":791,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L791-L794","doc":"Switched four-term photon `γ'(φ₀, φ₁, φ₀₁) = 1 + φ₀ σ₀ + φ₁ σ₁ + φ₀₁ (σ₀ σ₁⁻¹)` on the\nproton `(2,1)` weight space (`V_p = A₁ A₂⁻¹`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3B_nf_expansion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3B_nf_expansion","kind":"theorem","line":761,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L761-L774","doc":"Exact 5-term Gröbner normal-form matrix decomposition of `V_n³ = (B₁ B₂⁻¹)³` on `(1,2)`\n(with zero `e⁻ = B₁ B₂ B₁` component). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3A_nf_expansion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3A_nf_expansion","kind":"theorem","line":746,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L746-L759","doc":"Exact 5-term Gröbner normal-form matrix decomposition of `V_p³ = (A₁ A₂⁻¹)³` on `(2,1)`\n(with zero `e⁻ = A₁ A₂ A₁` component). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3_nf_cL_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3_nf_cL_sum","kind":"theorem","line":739,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L739-L744","doc":"When `L₊` and `L₋` combine under any diagonal trace on `V³`, their `O(h²)` pieces cancel\nidentically, leaving purely fourth order `c_{L₊} + c_{L₋} = (q - q⁻¹)⁴ = (q - 1)⁴(q + 1)⁴ / q⁴`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.nfBorCLminus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.nfBorCLminus","kind":"def","line":737,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L737-L737","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.nfBorCLplus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.nfBorCLplus","kind":"def","line":736,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L736-L736","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.nfBorCs1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.nfBorCs1","kind":"def","line":735,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L735-L735","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.nfBorCs0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.nfBorCs0","kind":"def","line":734,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L734-L734","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.nfBorC1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.nfBorC1","kind":"def","line":731,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L731-L733","doc":"Normal-form coefficients of the Borromean braid `V³ = (σ₀ σ₁⁻¹)³` in the 6D Hecke basis\n`{γ = 1, σ₀, σ₁, L₊ = σ₀σ₁, L₋ = σ₁σ₀, e⁻ = σ₀σ₁σ₀}` (with `c_{e⁻} = 0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjn_LminusB_eq_LplusB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjn_LminusB_eq_LplusB","kind":"theorem","line":724,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L724-L729","doc":"And `(Q₁₂^{(n)} + Q₂₃^{(n)})` has identical traces against `L₋ = B₂ B₁` and `L₊ = B₁ B₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjp_LminusA_eq_LplusA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjp_LminusA_eq_LplusA","kind":"theorem","line":717,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L717-L722","doc":"In particular, `(Q₁₂^{(p)} + Q₂₃^{(p)})` has identical traces against `L₋ = A₂ A₁` and `L₊ = A₁ A₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_diag_LminusB_eq_LplusB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_diag_LminusB_eq_LplusB","kind":"theorem","line":709,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L709-L715","doc":"For any diagonal operator `Matrix.diagonal d` on the neutron `(1,2)` weight space,\n`L₋ = B₂ B₁` and `L₊ = B₁ B₂` have identical traces because `B₂ B₁ = (B₁ B₂)ᵀ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_diag_LminusA_eq_LplusA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_diag_LminusA_eq_LplusA","kind":"theorem","line":701,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L701-L707","doc":"For any diagonal operator `Matrix.diagonal d` on the proton `(2,1)` weight space,\n`L₋ = A₂ A₁` and `L₊ = A₁ A₂` have identical traces because `A₂ A₁ = (A₁ A₂)ᵀ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.hadronicScaleE0_mul_hbar_eq_me","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.hadronicScaleE0_mul_hbar_eq_me","kind":"theorem","line":684,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L684-L688","doc":"Scale-hierarchy identity (Gap 5): `E₀ * (q² (1 - q⁻¹)) = m_e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.hadronicScaleE0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.hadronicScaleE0","kind":"def","line":681,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L681-L682","doc":"Hadronic energy scale `E₀ = m_e / (q (q - 1))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21_QAdj_diff_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21_QAdj_diff_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":667,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L667-L679","doc":"`e_{(2,1)}`-projected `(n - p)` adjacent-crossing electromagnetic trace difference on the\nBorromean nucleon braid `V³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21n_QAdjn_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21n_QAdjn_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":652,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L652-L665","doc":"`e_{(2,1)}`-projected adjacent-crossing electromagnetic trace on the neutron Borromean braid `V_n³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21p_QAdjp_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21p_QAdjp_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":637,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L637-L650","doc":"`e_{(2,1)}`-projected adjacent-crossing electromagnetic trace on the proton Borromean braid `V_p³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_EFn_QAdjn_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_EFn_QAdjn_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":629,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L629-L635","doc":"`e_{(3)}` (`EFn`) adjacent-crossing electromagnetic trace on the neutron Borromean braid `V_n³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_FEp_QAdjp_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_FEp_QAdjp_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":621,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L621-L627","doc":"`e_{(3)}` (`FEp`) adjacent-crossing electromagnetic trace on the proton Borromean braid `V_p³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21_strong_cartan_diff_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21_strong_cartan_diff_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":612,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L612-L619","doc":"Strong Cartan `(n - p)` trace difference on the `I = 1/2` nucleon sector `e_{(2,1)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21n_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21n_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":604,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L604-L610","doc":"On the `I = 1/2` nucleon sector `e_{(2,1)}`, the neutron Borromean trace equals `tr(V_n³) - 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21p_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e21p_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":596,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L596-L602","doc":"On the `I = 1/2` nucleon sector `e_{(2,1)}`, the proton Borromean trace equals `tr(V_p³) - 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e3n_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e3n_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":590,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L590-L594","doc":"On the `I = 3/2` decuplet sector `e_{(3)}`, the neutron Borromean trace is identically `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e3p_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_e3p_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":584,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L584-L588","doc":"On the `I = 3/2` decuplet sector `e_{(3)}`, the proton Borromean trace is identically `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_EFn_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_EFn_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":579,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L579-L582","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_FEp_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_FEp_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":574,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L574-L577","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e21n_comm_borromeanV3B","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e21n_comm_borromeanV3B","kind":"theorem","line":569,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L569-L572","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e21p_comm_borromeanV3A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e21p_comm_borromeanV3A","kind":"theorem","line":564,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L564-L567","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.EFn_comm_borromeanV3B","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.EFn_comm_borromeanV3B","kind":"theorem","line":558,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L558-L562","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.FEp_comm_borromeanV3A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.FEp_comm_borromeanV3A","kind":"theorem","line":552,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L552-L556","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.q4_add_q2_add_one_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.q4_add_q2_add_one_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":546,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L546-L550","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.qInt3_inv_eq_div","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.qInt3_inv_eq_div","kind":"theorem","line":542,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L542-L544","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.qInt3_eq_div","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.qInt3_eq_div","kind":"theorem","line":538,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L538-L540","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e21n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e21n","kind":"def","line":535,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L535-L536","doc":"Central idempotent `e_{(2,1)}` (`I = 1/2` nucleon projector) on the neutron `(1,2)` weight space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e3n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e3n","kind":"def","line":532,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L532-L533","doc":"Central idempotent `e_{(3)}` (`I = 3/2` decuplet projector) on the neutron `(1,2)` weight space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e21p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e21p","kind":"def","line":529,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L529-L530","doc":"Central idempotent `e_{(2,1)}` (`I = 1/2` nucleon projector) on the proton `(2,1)` weight space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e3p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.e3p","kind":"def","line":526,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L526-L527","doc":"Central idempotent `e_{(3)}` (`I = 3/2` decuplet projector) on the proton `(2,1)` weight space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.qInt3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.qInt3","kind":"def","line":523,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L523-L524","doc":"Quantum integer `[3]_q = q² + 1 + q⁻²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_borromeanV3B_six_crossing_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_borromeanV3B_six_crossing_sum","kind":"theorem","line":510,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L510-L519","doc":"Cyclic crossing-dressing derivative identity across the 3 periods of the Borromean\nneutron braid `V_n³ = (B₁ B₂⁻¹)³`: summing a local `(Q₁₂^{(n)}, Q₂₃^{(n)})` insertion over all\n6 crossings of `V_n³` equals `3 * tr((Q₁₂^{(n)} + Q₂₃^{(n)}) V_n³)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_borromeanV3A_six_crossing_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_borromeanV3A_six_crossing_sum","kind":"theorem","line":499,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L499-L508","doc":"Cyclic crossing-dressing derivative identity across the 3 periods of the Borromean\nproton braid `V_p³ = (A₁ A₂⁻¹)³`: summing a local `(Q₁₂^{(p)}, Q₂₃^{(p)})` insertion over all\n6 crossings of `V_p³` equals `3 * tr((Q₁₂^{(p)} + Q₂₃^{(p)}) V_p³)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdj_connected_diff_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdj_connected_diff_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":487,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L487-L497","doc":"Connected fourth-order `(n - p)` electromagnetic trace difference on the Borromean\nnucleon `V³ = (σ₁ σ₂⁻¹)³`: both the neutron and proton connected adjacent-crossing traces\nare `O((q - 1)⁴)` with opposite signs, so their difference reinforces with exact `q → 1`\nratio `(1/2 - (-1)) / 1 = 3/2` relative to the proton connected trace amplitude. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjn_borromeanV3_connected","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjn_borromeanV3_connected","kind":"theorem","line":476,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L476-L485","doc":"Connected fourth-order quantum braid trace on the neutron `(1,2)` weight space:\nsubtracting the static scalar `q = 1` Coulomb background `(-2/9) tr(V_n³)` from\n`tr((Q₁₂^{(n)} + Q₂₃^{(n)}) V_n³)` yields a fourth-order `(q - 1)⁴` polynomial with\nopposite sign and half the `q → 1` amplitude of `trace_QAdjp_borromeanV3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.QAdjn_eq_static_add_half_QAdjp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.QAdjn_eq_static_add_half_QAdjp","kind":"theorem","line":464,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L464-L474","doc":"Exact decomposition of the neutron adjacent-crossing charge matrix `Q₁₂^{(n)} + Q₂₃^{(n)}`\ninto its static scalar `q = 1` component `(-2/9) I₃` (of trace `-2/3`) plus `1/2` of the\ntraceless proton adjacent-crossing charge matrix `Q₁₂^{(p)} + Q₂₃^{(p)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_borromeanV3B","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_borromeanV3B","kind":"theorem","line":457,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L457-L462","doc":"The neutron Borromean trace `tr(V_n³)` equals the proton Borromean trace `tr(V_p³)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdj_diff_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdj_diff_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":449,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L449-L455","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjn_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjn_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":440,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L440-L447","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_Q23n_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_Q23n_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":432,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L432-L438","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_Q12n_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_Q12n_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":424,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L424-L430","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjp_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_QAdjp_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":414,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L414-L422","doc":"On the proton `(2,1)` weight space, the adjacent-crossing electromagnetic trace\n`tr((Q₁₂^{(p)} + Q₂₃^{(p)}) V_p³)` vanishes to fourth order `(q - 1)⁴` at `q = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_Q23p_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_Q23p_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":407,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L407-L412","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_Q12p_borromeanV3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_Q12p_borromeanV3","kind":"theorem","line":400,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L400-L405","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_borromeanV3A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.trace_borromeanV3A","kind":"theorem","line":394,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.lean#L394-L398","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3B","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonWeightSpaceTwoTerm.borromeanV3B","kind":"def","line":392,"sourceLink